    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": "+12%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz"
  },
  {
    "id": "02",
    "text": "很多人以为加个对话框就等于做出了AI产品，其实不是。",
    "duration": 5.76,
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": "+12%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz"
  },
  {
    "id": "b23",
    "text": "那真正该怎么拆？按顺序看结构。",
    "duration": 3.72,
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": "+12%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz"
  },
  {
    "id": "03",
    "text": "先问清帮谁、解决什么问题。场景清楚了再谈能力，最后才是体验。",
    "duration": 6.6,
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural",
    "rate": "+12%",
    "pitch": "+0Hz"
  },
  {
    "id": "b34",
    "text": "记住，能力不该抢戏。",
